===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm}}, from {{etyl|fro}} {{term|pilier|lang=fro}} , from {{etyl|ML.}} {{term|pilare||a pillar|lang=la}}, from {{etyl|la}} {{term|pila||a pillar, pier, mole|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|En-us-pillar.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A large [[post]], often used as supporting [[architecture]].
# Something resembling such a structure.
#: ''a '''pillar''' of smoke''
# An essential part of something that provides support.
#: ''He's a '''pillar''' of the community.''

